# Root filesystems for the lab's Raspberry Pi 5 (tools/netboot.py); install
# as /etc/exports.d/edgenode.exports (docs/lab.md). Only the Pi's address,
# read-only, as the images' root filesystem is, and root on the Pi stays
# root (no_root_squash), so it can read root's files.
/srv/edgenode/nfs 192.168.1.164(ro,sync,no_subtree_check,no_root_squash)
